        <activityName xml:lang="en">Iron scrap, from concrete demolition, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Iron scrap, from concrete demolition, at plant
This is a multi output process of concrete demolition entering the recycling plant. An economic allocation is applied between the disposal service of concrete demolition and the recycling product RC-C and recycled iron.;
UUID: d49a1e33-f3c2-4d3a-8d00-4c4d5b9c3132
Includes the infrastructure, energy demand and waste of the recycling process of concrete demolition
Location: Data from Eberhard AG, Switzerland
Technology: dry processing, stationary crusher
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d49a1e33-f3c2-4d3a-8d00-4c4d5b9c3132.xml</text>
